    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a cryptic message with coordinates, you arrive at Sunset station, machine's first stronghold in the past. Only ruins remind you of its former glory, and hordes of mutants roam around trying to tear apart uninvited guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/b7ed44173b8d04db2898e1055b50d413.poster.avif?t=1746609020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/b7ed44173b8d04db2898e1055b50d413.webm?t=1746609020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/b7ed44173b8d04db2898e1055b50d413.mp4?t=1746609020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different machines with their own unique characteristics, skills and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big branch of abilities and improvements for each machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 different scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 weapons and items to help you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants, chiefs and butchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious obelisks and holographic keys system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cows and cotton candy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for mouse, keyboard, controllers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/ab27492b18770c88fbf0a634e4e22d15.poster.avif?t=1746609020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/ab27492b18770c88fbf0a634e4e22d15.webm?t=1746609020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414740/extras/ab27492b18770c88fbf0a634e4e22d15.mp4?t=1746609020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
